[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_02_0010","text":"大家……\n刨冰……刨好了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_02_0020","text":"雾子～，谢谢～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_02_0030","text":"接下来只要淋上糖浆就行了……\n但选什么口味好呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_02_0040","text":"嘛，刨冰的糖浆\n听说其实都是一个味道就是了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_02_0050","text":"麻美～美\n这种事靠心情！心情才是最重要的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_02_0060","text":"干脆按喜欢的颜色来决定，也是个办法呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_02_0062","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_02_0070","text":"──那，这样怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_02_0080","text":"全料豪华特别版"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_02_0090","text":"诶……\n五颜六色的好漂亮～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_02_0100","text":"好开心的颜色……呢……♪\n呵呵……"}]
